    "body": "It seems per https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?%3Cscript%3E%0As%20%3D%20new%20Uint8Array(new%20ArrayBuffer(8))%3B%0Aw(s.buffer.byteLength)%0Aw(s.byteLength)%3B%0ApostMessage(s%2C%20%22*%22%2C%20[s.buffer])%3B%0Aw(s.buffer.byteLength)%0Aw(s.byteLength)%3B%0Aw(new%20TextEncoder().encodeInto(%22fd%22%2C%20s))%3B%0A%3C%2Fscript%3E implementations already do the right thing here, but this is indeed a bug.",
